L244: ## 【114†Adding new colors #】
L245: 
L246: To add new colors, you need to add them to your CSS file.
L247: 
L248: src/routes/layout.css
L249: 
L250:     `:root {
L251:       --warning: oklch(0.84 0.16 84);
L252:       --warning-foreground: oklch(0.28 0.07 46);
L253:     }
L254: 
L255:     .dark {
L256:       --warning: oklch(0.41 0.11 46);
L257:       --warning-foreground: oklch(0.99 0.02 95);
L258:     }
L259: 
L260:     @theme inline {
L261:       --color-warning: var(--warning);
L262:       --color-warning-foreground: var(--warning-foreground);
L263:     }`
L264: 
L265: Copy
L266: You can now use the `warning` utility class in your components.
L267: 
L268:     `<div class="bg-warning text-warning-foreground"></div>`
L269: 
L270: Copy
